[{"type": "chat", "time": 21903.254, "timestamp": "06:05:03", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "HUH????"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21910.23, "timestamp": "06:05:10", "text": "人，這簡直是個騙局。就像我媽的房間，她房間裡裝的是三星空調，那玩意兒好多了，兩分鐘房間就涼快下來了。這台冷氣我得開三個小時，房間才稍微涼快一點兒，浪費電，而且我付的錢根本沒用。我不知道，這台空調是福布斯牌的，現在福布斯牌的好像便宜點兒了。哦，天哪，我的充電電池！"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21910.826, "timestamp": "06:05:10", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ok im bacc"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21920.468, "timestamp": "06:05:20", "text": "你們有用充電電池嗎？還是每次都"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21921.85, "timestamp": "06:05:21", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Kronos did you hear what he said"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21925.99, "timestamp": "06:05:25", "text": "去買"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21927.121, "timestamp": "06:05:27", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21929.35, "timestamp": "06:05:29", "text": "電池浪費錢？我之所以選擇充電電池，是因為我以前買過一些無線鍵盤和滑鼠，用來連接我的Stream PC。那時候我還有一台Jockey PC、一台APC遊戲PC和一台Stream PC。我想"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21932.022, "timestamp": "06:05:32", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wut he talkin bout"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21932.457, "timestamp": "06:05:32", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he can't eat with his bare hands"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21942.883, "timestamp": "06:05:42", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u dont eat with bare hands joq?"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21950.862, "timestamp": "06:05:50", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "with spoon is better though"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21953.365, "timestamp": "06:05:53", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how do u eat roti/parotta?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21953.59, "timestamp": "06:05:53", "text": "用無線設備，所以就買了這些便宜的無線鍵盤和滑鼠。結果你猜怎麼著？鍵盤和滑鼠居然有缺陷，電池三分鐘就沒電了，整個電池都徹底沒電了。新電池花了三分鐘就得換了，天哪，我當時就想，與其買這麼多電池浪費，還不如直接買個"}]